activity Monitor Seismic Activity
activity Issue Tsunami Alert
activity Evacuate Coastal Areas
activity Dispatch Emergency Services
activity Provide Medical Assistance
activity Establish Emergency Shelters
activity Distribute Relief Supplies
activity Assess Infrastructure Damage
activity Restore Communication Networks
activity Conduct Search and Rescue
bind Monitor Seismic Activity: Magnitude
bind Evacuate Coastal Areas: Evacuees
bind Provide Medical Assistance: Injuries
bind Establish Emergency Shelters: Shelters
bind Conduct Search and Rescue: Rescued
bind Assess Infrastructure Damage: Damage Severity
bind Restore Communication Networks: Communication Status
bind Distribute Relief Supplies: Supply Cost
bind Issue Tsunami Alert: Alert Level, Estimated Arrival Time
Magnitude: float between 0.0 and 10.0
Evacuees: integer between 0 and 100000
Injuries: integer between 0 and 50000
Shelters: integer between 0 and 1000
Rescued: integer between 0 and 50000
Damage Severity: Minor, Moderate, Severe
Communication Status: Operational, Partially Operational, Down
Supply Cost: float between 0.0 and 10000000.0
Alert Level: Watch, Warning, Cancel
Estimated Arrival Time: integer between 1 and 1440
Init[Monitor Seismic Activity] | |
Response[Monitor Seismic Activity, Issue Tsunami Alert] |A.Magnitude > 7.0 | |
Response[Issue Tsunami Alert, Evacuate Coastal Areas] | | |0,60,m
Response[Dispatch Emergency Services, Provide Medical Assistance] | | |0,24,h
Response[Establish Emergency Shelters, Distribute Relief Supplies] | | |0,48,h
Response[Assess Infrastructure Damage, Restore Communication Networks] | | |0,72,h
Response[Restore Communication Networks, Restore Communication Networks] |A.Communication Status is Down |T.Communication Status is Operational |
Precedence[Provide Medical Assistance, Dispatch Emergency Services] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Conduct Search and Rescue, Assess Infrastructure Damage] | | |